{"action":"created","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy/issues/23138","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy/issues/23138/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy/issues/23138/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy/issues/23138/events","html_url":"https://github.com/numpy/numpy/pull/23138","id":1565946464,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAA3dP85I_-fp","number":23138,"title":"DOC: add CITATION.cff file for GitHub support","user":{"login":"mwtoews","id":895458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NTQ1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/895458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews","html_url":"https://github.com/mwtoews","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/received_events","type":"User","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6359990,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MzU5OTkw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy/labels/04%20-%20Documentation","name":"04 - Documentation","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2023-02-01T11:31:01Z","updated_at":"2023-02-03T12:22:54Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy/pulls/23138","html_url":"https://github.com/numpy/numpy/pull/23138","diff_url":"https://github.com/numpy/numpy/pull/23138.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/numpy/numpy/pull/23138.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR is very similar to #19733 (ping @tupui) but goes much further to implement a [CITATION.cff](https://citation-file-format.github.io/) file. This machine-readable (YAML) document contains both a software citation and a "preferred-citation" based on the _Nature_ publication. By default, GitHub's "Cite this repository" tool will offer APA and BibTeX versions of the preferred citation, which is why CITATION.bib is removed.

The author listing for the software can (and should) change with time. I've populated it based on the [contributors listing](https://github.com/numpy/numpy/graphs/contributors), more-or-less ordered by commits. I've only included folks with a "significant number" of commits, e.g. 50ish or more. I've done my best to gather the correct information, apologies for any errors or omissions. The last author is simply "others" as a catch-all for the other 1400 contributors.
 
